WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.810
I'm so sorry, Domon.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.520
I'm about to release
your father to you now.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:35.440
And though I realize I'm in no
position to ask for a favor...

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:39.410
...please. Please,
save my daughter!

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.740
Please.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:52.920
Now, everyone.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.050
This story is finally
about to come to an end.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.260
The enormous resurrected
Devil Gundam...

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.850
...is pulling the whole universe
into the most fearsome war.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:08.850
Will Domon Kasshu be able
to rescue Rain in the end?

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.020
Yes...

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:16.190
...against his last opponent,
Major Ulube's Grand Master Gundam!

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.030
And now!

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.650
Gundam Fight!

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.240
Ready! Go!

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:28.250
Earth's SOS!
Gundam Federation Rescue

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:42.390
Dr. Kasshu's capsule has
safely been retrieved.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:42.890
Good!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.890
I'm taking him out of
his cryogenic state.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.680
That's right.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.350
All we have now is Dr. Kasshu.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.730
The only one who knows the
Devil Gundam's weaknesses.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.650
The bastards.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.030
So, they've gotten inside.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.410
However, such bacteria
within the body...

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:09.380
...are destined to be devoured
by the Devil Gundam cells.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.580
I'm coming, Rain.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:15.840
Wait for me.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.590
There's more behind us!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.970
Easy! I'll just blow them apart!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.560
Wait, Chibodee!

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.270
Shut up!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.610
What happened?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.320
It's too late for such
pathetic resistance.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.240
The time has come for the
mighty Devil Gundam...

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.910
...to take possession
of the Earth for me!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.290
Wh-what's causing this tremor?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.300
What's that?

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.940
It's heading for Earth.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.540
Wh-what is that?

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:35.040
What's happening?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:36.500
Do it!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.600
That giant is devouring
the whole Earth!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.780
You mustn't look,
Miss Maria Louise!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.370
At this rate, the Devil Gundam
will swallow up all of Earth!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.700
Dr. Kasshu! Hasn't the
doctor awakened yet?!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.450
We're working on it!

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.580
I'm sorry.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.170
It'll take a little while longer.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.130
Are we finished for good?

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:24.960
Well?

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:28.430
Do you see why a Gundam Fight
to determine the right...

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.220
...to rule the universe
is no longer necessary?!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.300
Yes.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.520
It's only natural, as the
master of the Devil Gundam...

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.390
...that I become the ruler!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.480
If anybody disagrees, come at me!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.150
Ulube...

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.660
Don't give up, Domon!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.630
Nobel Hulahoop!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.120
That technique!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:56.830
Domon!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.460
Don't hand Earth over
to the Devil Gundam!

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.130
Allenby!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.000
And there, too!

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.880
Mandala Gundam,
here to serve you!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.470
Mr. Domon! Allow me to assist
you in the name of justice!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.140
It's Kyral of Neo Nepal!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.180
I'm not the only one who's here.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.480
Look!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.730
You guys...

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:27.940
Sorry I'm late!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.530
Thanks to the Neo Sweden Base...

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:33.280
...many more of us
are being deployed!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.310
Plus those already in space!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.500
Neo Egypt Colony...

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.210
...Sphinx Gundam!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.330
Prepared to engage in battle!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.590
Nether Gundam of Neo Holland...

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.670
...Mark 2 through Mark
40, ready for takeoff!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.100
Mothership of Neo
Denmark, Josefina!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:57.430
All Mermaid Gundam
prototypes! Launch!

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.610
L-look at all the Gundams.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.110
And more to come.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.450
All Gundams of the world
shall gather here!

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.280
We shall create a World
Gundam Federation.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.080
We shall protect the Earth...

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.870
...and fight as one to
grasp victory for all!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.160
Yeah!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.380
The Gundam Fight has
taught us one thing!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.510
That the Earth belongs to no one!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.840
Our mother planet is in danger!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.510
Who cares about
nationality and race?!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.230
Amazing...

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.690
The Gundams that had been
fighting each other over Earth...

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.900
...now fight as one to save Earth!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.120
But they're just sheep
without a shepherd.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.290
You were enemies until yesterday.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.790
Think you can work together
so easily to defeat me?

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.330
We'll see about that.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:04.960
What?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.960
Listen carefully, Ulube.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.130
We may come from
different nations...

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.170
...but once we're out
of the battle ring...

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.590
...we're friends who
communicate through our fists!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.180
And these fists gather as one!

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:20.640
Their loud roar tells
us to defeat you.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:21.720
Yes.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.350
Let us demonstrate.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.020
Our...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.850
...power!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.610
You!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.820
You pests!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.240
We've gotten rid of all the
tentacles that descended to Earth.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:44.750
Good!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.920
We must now focus all
of our strength...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.380
...to defend the Earth!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.130
It seems to be in pain.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.380
The Devil Gundam?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:56.510
That's right.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.550
Not even the Devil
Gundam is invulnerable.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:03.270
With our own human hands, we
have the strength to defeat it.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.770
Dr. Kasshu!

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.270
Domon! Can you hear me?!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:10.650
Dad?

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.320
You've awakened?!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.360
I've been briefed on the facts.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:14.990
Listen.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:20.700
Shut down the Colony's generator
which serves as the power source.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.740
That's the only way.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.200
All right, Dad.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.080
Domon...

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.250
Dad?

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:33.710
You've grown up.
You've truly grown up.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.590
Yeah.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:37.470
I have to go!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.060
That Dr. Kasshu...

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.770
Why did you interfere?

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.180
Guess I have no choice.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:53.520
So I'll be in a Gundam Fight
match, just like the old days.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:58.150
Good thing I planned for this
by keeping in good shape.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.910
And with the Shuffle
Alliance as my enemy...

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.620
...the match won't
be a waste of time!

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:10.380
Now come out! Serve
as my arms and legs!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.250
Grand Master Gundam!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:33.110
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.370
The residents are safe.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.710
Are you sure?

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.630
Yes, but we can't just
go in and attack.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.670
Don't worry.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.050
The shelter can be separated
from the main body.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:03.300
Right now we're trying to gain
access to its hidden circuit.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:08.140
Glad you're taking care
of the residents first.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.980
You might just turn out to
be a great prime minister.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.150
This is no time for teasing!

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.530
Looks like we're losing the signal!

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:18.900
Allow me.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.740
I'll try the subspace code.

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:25.700
Okay.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.040
I've got their position.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.910
Follow that route, Domon.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.550
I believe the power generator
is directly above us.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:41.970
Yeah.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.840
I bet it's the heart of this body.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.550
What's wrong, Neo China?

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.800
Are you scared?

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.720
Just trembling with excitement!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.020
We've made it this far.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.150
Let's ride this out to the very end.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.770
Wait, guys.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.770
From this point on,
I'm going in alone.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.150
Hey.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.530
You can't be serious.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.820
Guys. Hear me out.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:08.530
All this happened because my
family developed the DG cells.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:12.000
And right now, my
main objective...

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.210
...is not a matter of saving Earth.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.500
It's to rescue Rain who's imprisoned.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.090
Is that all you have to say?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.130
We knew that all along.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:26.260
We're not doing this out of
duty to the Shuffle Alliance.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.430
We get an adrenaline
rush fighting with you.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.680
That's all.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.390
We just enjoy having
a rowdy old time.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.980
The crest is one thing.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.440
What we feel is another.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.600
You guys...

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.570
You're nuts.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.850
Yeah.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.200
We're completely nuts.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.180
This is our final battle!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.780
So, that's the generator.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.140
You are correct.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:20.060
Greetings to you,
Shuffle Alliance.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.320
Ulube!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:25.490
I'd like to commend all of
you for making it this far.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.070
However, your efforts...

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:27.780
Shut up!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.830
Just return Rain right
now and we'll go!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.040
Or else...

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.540
Or else what?

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.000
I will kill you.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.750
Oh?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:43.710
You're the prince coming to
save the captive princess.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.630
That would make me...

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.470
...the evil sorcerer
who stands in your way.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.090
Huh?

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.640
Then come after me.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:56.890
This invincible main power
generator will be your opponent!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:01.770
Th-this is it?

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.150
Yes!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.780
Its name is Grand Master Gundam!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:07.990
Now!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.280
Come and get me!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.960
It's a combination
of the Four Kings.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.420
Just a bunch of guys
we've beaten before.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.840
I'll finish him with one blow!

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.300
Wait! Chibodee!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.170
Bursting!

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:31.590
Machinegun Punch!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.690
Chibodee!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.360
Rose Hurricane!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.910
George! Chibodee!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:58.540
Let's go!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.210
Right!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:14:59.790
Wait!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.460
You think that'll...

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:04.880
Wha...?!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.390
Sai Saici!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.230
Argo!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.820
Think these measly
techniques will defeat me?

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.860
If that's not enough,
then how about this?!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.820
School of the Undefeated
of the East...

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.530
...the winds of the king!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.790
Full power!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:42.960
Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.800
How's that?

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.930
N-not a scratch...!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.480
Let's see.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.770
I do believe it's my turn next.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.390
Take this!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.860
You must realize by now...

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:17.030
...that the Devil Gundam
is the ultimate life form!

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.620
No matter how many of
you maggots come at me...

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.960
...you're not worthy enemies!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.550
Wh-what's this...?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.420
What's going on inside?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.150
Wh-what is that...?

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.790
It's the devil.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.450
That is truly the Devil Gundam!

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.790
Don't tell me...

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:08.130
...the monster is planning to
descend to the Earth like that?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.590
That's right.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.300
A transmission!

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.420
What?!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:17.840
Listen to me, you
foolish worms!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.970
These magnificent DG cells...

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:23.140
...have redefined the future
and given us unlimited power!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.140
Behold!

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:27.020
Thanks to the cells, I'm
ruler of the universe!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.940
That is no longer Ulube.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.610
It's the Devil Gundam itself.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.820
That's right.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.110
The future belongs to DG cells!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:38.280
Humanity shall perish at last!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.660
Is there no way to beat it?

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.000
Is this the end?

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:52.640
Domon!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.550
Don't give up!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.630
Even if we're crushed...

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.470
No matter what, I have no regrets.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.430
We shared those precious
moments with you, Bro!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:08.600
So let's defeat this guy!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.690
Together!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.230
B-but...

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.440
...I've got nothing left.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.360
You fool!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:17.740
Domon...

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:20.070
Is that the extent of your abilities?

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:21.570
Master...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.290
And you still think
you can carry on...

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.790
...the school of the
Undefeated of the East.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.330
But...

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.240
What's the matter?

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.250
Wasn't it you who said
you'd rescue Rain?

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.090
Schwarz?

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.760
You must rise, Domon.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.510
You're the only one who
can put an end to this.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.180
Kyoji...

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.890
Mom!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:51.940
So, you see...

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.440
...we can't afford to lose
Earth to something like this.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.780
Otherwise...

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.200
...the loss of our lives
would have no meaning.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.410
Master...

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.330
I don't want to lose anymore!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.500
The precious people...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.290
And this world...

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.000
...we all live in!

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:23.890
Master's taught me that...

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.970
...our great motherland...

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.890
...our precious planet Earth...

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.890
...is truly the highest form of life!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.740
What the...?!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.410
Our spirits are aflame.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.660
If we feel the fire...

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.710
...there is nothing we can't defeat!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.040
And now this hand of
mine is burning red!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:58.550
Its loud roar tells
me to grasp victory!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.110
Erupting...

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:10.310
...Shuffle Alliance Attack!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.370
Lt-it stopped...

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.580
Domon did it?

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.590
Did we win?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.550
Hurray!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:50.770
- We did it!
- Hurray!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.400
Doctor...

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.400
No. Wait.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.280
What is this?!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.820
That's impossible!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:12.830
We definitely defeated the
one at the power generator!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.620
Th-this is devastating.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.860
To think it was too late.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.290
Doctor...

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:24.050
Now that it's come to this,
we have only one choice.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.630
Stop the life unit.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.140
We must stop Rain.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.640
How can we stop Rain?

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.270
You mean, take her life?!

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:34.100
No way!

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.190
After all this...

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:40.900
...how can you expect
me to give up Rain?

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.360
No one's going to touch Rain.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:47.150
No way!

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:48.610
Wait, Domon!

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:49.950
Don't go alone!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.370
It's useless.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:01.010
Rain will never return to you.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:06.340
Rain!

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:10.180
I won't hand you over
to the Devil Gundam!

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:13.350
I will rescue you!
No matter what!

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.520
Wait for me!

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:28.070
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:30.570
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.870
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.410
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:47.220
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.180 --> 00:23:01.480
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.610
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:17.080
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:25.920
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:35.220
Everybody, it's almost
time to say goodbye!

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:37.970
The Gundam Federation
protecting Earth is in trouble!

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:42.270
The Devil Gundam transforms
into its final form using Rain!

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:45.270
And it attacks Domon who
has come to save her!

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:48.320
What destiny awaits them
and the whole universe?!

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:51.900
Next, on Mobile Fighter G
Gundam, the final episode...

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:55.990
God Gundam's Great Triumph!
A Hopeful Future...

00:23:54.120 --> 00:24:00.760
God Gundam's Great Triumph!
A Hopeful Future...

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.830
Ready! Go!
